l wall).\n- Remote access = **bind the Tailscale interface + a shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*`.\n\n**Provenance**\n- The decisions above are documented as adversarial findings driven by the Crucible planning process.\n- Member documents backing this summary: Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Decision Log, and Execution Log.\n\n*Note: this is grounded strictly in the supplied anchors and member-document titles; no per-wave build detail was present in the provided excerpts to summarize further.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":92354,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e4c7865-16f5-4b0d-802b-dacdf43fdd38","uuid":"e35f4685-5668-413a-a95f-e64b8e94ac8d","request_id":"req_011CcJoEqvaAN8ZkUoNyccbD"}
